  "answer": "This is a known Command Palette Dock bug. The dock is placed 1 pixel off the screen edge, so the wallpaper or a black or white line shows through. PowerToys#47652 is the main tracking issue, and the other two were closed as duplicates of it. A maintainer said in #48446 that a fix would ship in an upcoming PowerToys release, but one user still saw the gap on 0.100.0. Update PowerToys to the newest version, since you are on 0.100.2. If the gap is still there, add your details to #47652. Two workarounds from those tickets may help. Restart PowerToys, because the gap went away after a restart for one user. It came back if the dock was switched off and on again. The other user said the gap disappeared when PowerToys ran as Administrator."
 },
